descriptionByLocale.en:
Do you want the freedom of temporary work and the safety of permanent employment? For 30 years we have been joining hundreds of companies in the technical sectors of construction, construction and industry throughout Switzerland, proposing them the best talents. However, we do not hide that we are demanding. So, if you are a motivated and extremely enthusiastic person, join our team for the position of Brick Drivers.

Your task:
• Ensure the guidance and handling of the compressors rollers in various asphalt yards;
• Perform the compaction operations of the asphalt in compliance with the requirements of quality, technical tolerances and safety standards;
• Work closely with the teams of drawing up the asphalt and with the foreman to ensure the proper performance of the work;
• Perform the ordinary maintenance of the vehicle, ensure its proper functioning and signal any anomalies or need for technical interventions;
• Apply strictly the Suva directives, the

safety instructions and the procedures in place at the construction sites.

And now we're talking about you?
• You must prove that you have at least 2 years of experience as a finishing machine operator for asphalt (demand);
• You have a driver's license for category M6, indispensable for the performance of the task;
• You have solid knowledge in the field of road work and civil engineering;
• You show autonomy, rigour and excellent team spirit;
• You have good physical form and show a strong sense of responsibility;
• It is available for the season and ready to engage in deep work on the construction sites.

Do you care? Love and master your profession and want to put your skills at the service of projects that really matter? Then this offer is made for you. From us, your expertise makes a difference and contributes directly to the success of the construction sites.

What we offer: Your contact person for this location is Valentin COLIN. He will be able to accompany you, advise you and answer all your position questions. We will only answer applications whose profile matches the description you have requested.

